&lt;strong&gt;Roberta Bernasconi&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(IUAV University of Venice)&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;nbsp; &amp;ldquo;Threading Knowledges: Genealogies of Performance Pedagogies&amp;rdquo;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Bruna Bonanno&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(University of Milan)&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;nbsp; &amp;ldquo;Offshore dramaturgy: How to Spin a Yarn&amp;rdquo;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
